'''Ultimate Swampfire''' is the [[Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of a [[Methanosian]].

==Appearance==
Ultimate Swampfire has the appearance of a humanoid tree instead of a walking plant like [[Swampfire]]. His body is dark brown in color, and now has three blue gooey shells containing an organic, blue-colored gel-like solution of kerosene napalm on each of his arms and a large one on his back.{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Escape From Aggregor]]''; [[:File:EFA DVD Ultimate Swampfire Data.png|file]]|group = DVD|name = DVD}} He also has a smaller pod on his front, through which his face can be seen. Ultimate Swampfire's body is composed of petrified wood.

Ultimate Swampfire wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

