Ultimate Swampfire has a high degree of chlorokinesis, allowing him to telepathically interface with plant life, among other things. Additionally, he has an increased degree of chlorokinesis compared to his [[Swampfire|devolved counterpart]].{{Refn|group = DVD|name = DVD}}

Ultimate Swampfire can ignite a kerosene gel-like solution in his arms to generate blue-colored flames.{{Refn|group = DVD|name = DVD}} These flames are much hotter than Swampfire's, as they melted through a brick wall<ref name="UA">''[[Ultimate Aggregor (Episode)|Ultimate Aggregor]]''</ref> and can disintegrate a [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapien]]'s shard projectiles in midair, the latter of which was demonstrated by his [[Sentient Ultimate Swampfire|sentient counterpart]].<ref>''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]''</ref>{{Refn|Despite methane possessing a higher [[Wikipedia:Heat of combustion|calorific value]] than kerosene in the real world, meaning it burns hotter and provides more heat, Ultimate Swampfire's flames are depicted as significantly more powerful than his unevolved counterpart's in the show.|group = note}} Ultimate Swampfire is also capable of limited flight through means of launching fire from his palms as jet propulsion.<ref name="TFB2">''[[The Final Battle: Part 2]]''</ref>

Ultimate Swampfire has fire bombs on his arms which he can pick off and throw as lethal explosives, as one of these fire bombs was able to completely destroy the [[Plant Alien]] after being thrown inside of it.<ref name="TBS">''[[The Big Story]]''</ref> He can also shoot out a large cluster of fire bombs from his hands that separate and detonate individually, providing a blast range over a wider area.<ref name="TFB2" />

Ultimate Swampfire retains Swampfire's ability to generate seeds and vines,<ref name="B10KR">''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]''</ref> as well as his regeneration{{Refn|[[:File:Matt Wayne's Opinion on Ultimate Swampfire's Regeneration.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Swampbombprofile.PNG]]|group = CN}}{{Refn|[[:File:Utimate-swampfire.png]]|group = CN}} and elasticity.<ref name="TFB2" />

Ultimate Swampfire is very strong, as he was able to force the mouth of the Plant Alien open to throw a fire bomb inside.<ref name="TBS" />

Ultimate Swampfire is faster than he looks, as seen when he snuck up behind [[Eon]] so fast that he didn't notice.<ref name="B10KR" />

Ultimate Swampfire can breathe and generate fire underwater.<ref name="TFB2" />

==Weaknesses==
[[File:TFOC262.PNG|thumb|218x218px|Electricity Vulnerability]]
Ultimate Swampfire is vulnerable to electricity, such as that generated by an [[Amperi (Classic)|Amperi]].<ref name="UA" /><ref>''[[The Forge of Creation]]''</ref>

==History==
===Alien Force===
*Ultimate Swampfire first appeared in ''[[The Final Battle: Part 2]]'', where he battled [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] as the [[Chimeran Hammer (Classic)|Chimeran Hammer]] went underwater before switching into [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]].

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Ultimate Aggregor (Episode)|Ultimate Aggregor]]'', Ultimate Swampfire led [[Alien Force|the team]] in breaking into [[Los Soledad]], easily defeated the [[Aggrebot]]s stationed there, and fought the mind-controlled [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda Galaxy]] aliens before being defeated by [[Ra'ad]] and switching into [[Nanomech]].
*In ''[[The Forge of Creation]]'', Ultimate Swampfire was defeated by [[Ultimate Aggregor]].
*In ''[[Eye of the Beholder]],'' Ultimate Swampfire fought the [[Churl]] and [[Sentinels of Monawk|three guardians]].
*In ''[[The Big Story]]'', Ultimate Swampfire defeated the [[Plant Alien]].
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Ultimate Swampfire battled [[Eon]], but was defeated and aged to dust by the latter's time ray. After Eon was defeated, however, Ultimate Swampfire was restored by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Ultimate Swampfire confronted [[Albedo]] in a dream.

