==Games==
===Video Games===
====[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]====
[[File:Ultimate Swampfire Cosmic Destruction.png|thumb|Ultimate Swampfire in ''Cosmic Destruction'']]

In Level 2, Ultimate Swampfire flies up the [[Eiffel Tower (Cosmic Destruction)|Eiffel Tower]] to battle [[Sunder]] and various [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]] aliens. After defeating him, Ultimate Swampfire grabs the piece of [[Potis Altiare]] Sunder stole and jumped from the collapsing Eiffel Tower.

Ultimate Swampfire has firebombs, which he can throw at enemies, by spinning, spread them out around him, or launch them at enemies, homing in on them like missiles. He can also launch a flamethrower-like stream of fire from both hands.

By punching the ground, Ultimate Swampfire can create a large fire blast.

Ultimate Swampfire can fly by launching fire from his palms as jet propulsion.

Like the rest of the other playable [[Ultimate Forms]], Ultimate Swampfire can knock out enemies with a single punch.

===Online Games===
[[File:Ultimate_Swampfire_Exosuit.png|thumb|Ultimate Swampfire Exosuit in ''Project Exonaut'']]
====[[FusionFall]]====
Ultimate Swampfire appears on [[Chimeran Hammer (Classic)|Vilgax's ship]] trapped that the player must save.

====[[Project Exonaut]]====
Ultimate Swampfire is a playable Exosuit of the Banzai Squadron on ''Project Exonaut''. His Weapon Mod decreases the Marksman's clip to 3 but increases its range, damage, and speed. Ultimate Swampfire is available for purchase at Level 30 for 2000 coins.

====Toon Football====
Ultimate Swampfire is a toon football player in ''Toon Football''.

