==Trivia==
*Ultimate Swampfire is the first [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] to be used by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]], which is a reference to Ben always turning into fire-based aliens first: [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]], [[Swampfire]], and Ultimate Swampfire.
**He is also the only Ultimate form used by Ben to appear before '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''.
*Ultimate Swampfire is the only Ultimate form to be temporarily destroyed and removed from the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]].
*In a beta cover for an issue of the [[Comics|Cartoon Network Action Pack!]], Ultimate Swampfire was colored red with yellow napalm shells, resembling Heatblast.
*Ultimate Swampfire was the [[Alien of the Month]] in October 2011.
*Ultimate Swampfire was designed by [[Steven Choi]].{{Refn|[[:File:Steven choi designed Ultimate Swampfire.PNG]]|group = SC}}
[[File:Waterhazard and Ultimate Swampfire in Family Guy.png|thumb|Ultimate Swampfire figure in '''Family Guy''']]
*In the '''[[Wikipedia:Family Guy|Family Guy]]''' episode ''Quagmire and Meg'', during the scene where the old man is reading to his child, two toys that resemble [[Waterhazard]] and Ultimate Swampfire can be seen.
*Had Ultimate Swampfire appeared in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' as one of Albedo's transformations, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] would have probably redesigned him to look a little creepier, "like when Ichabod Crane rides through that haunted forest".{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ultimate Swampfire Concept.png]]|group = DJW}} 
*If [[Ben 23]] were to have an Ultimatrix and use its Evolution Feature on [[Mr. Mucky]], the resulting transformation would be called "Monsterizered Mr. Mucky".{{Refn|[[:File:Monsterizered Mr. Mucky Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ultimate Swampfire was originally supposed to be completely on fire.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/8/83/The_Final_Battle_Part_2_Script_As_Broadcast.pdf ''The Final Battle: Part 2'' Script As Broadcast]|group = script}}
*Ultimate Swampfire was originally not supposed to appear in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*Ultimate Swampfire was Derrick's favorite Ultimate form because he liked how he looked the most, considering him to be a million times better than regular Swampfire.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Likes Ultimate Swampfire's Design 1.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Likes Ultimate Swampfire's Design 2.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on the Ultimates' Designs.png]]|group = DJW}}

